      "x": 80,
      "y": 6635,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "5. STRAIN PLANE AND STRESS LAWS",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6675,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "c = neutral-axis depth below the compression face; p = fibre coordinate from the centroid,",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6705,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "positive towards the compression face; H = section depth in that direction; dt = depth of the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6735,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "extreme bar. The strain plane pivots about A (bar at −εud), B (face at εcu2) or C (εc2 at",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 6765,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "(1 − εc2/εcu2)·H), whichever governs for the depth c (EC2 Fig. 6.1). Compression positive.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7110,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Strain at fibre p",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4o",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 7136,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\varepsilon\\left(c,p,H,d_{t}\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{|ll}\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{ud}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{d_{t}-c} & \\mathrm{if}\\ c<\\frac{\\varepsilon_{cu2}d_{t}}{\\varepsilon_{cu2}+\\varepsilon_{ud}}\\\\\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{cu2}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{c} & \\mathrm{if}\\ c\\le H\\\\\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{c2}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{c-\\left(1-\\frac{\\varepsilon_{c2}}{\\varepsilon_{cu2}}\\right)H} & \\mathrm{otherwise}\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7300,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Concrete stress, parabola-rectangle (EC2 3.17), no tension",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4q",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 7336,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\sigma_{c}\\left(\\varepsilon\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{|ll}\\displaystyle 0\\,\\mathrm{MPa} & \\mathrm{if}\\ \\varepsilon\\le0\\\\\\displaystyle f_{cd}\\left(1-\\left(1-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_{c2}}\\right)^2\\right) & \\mathrm{if}\\ \\varepsilon<\\varepsilon_{c2}\\\\\\displaystyle f_{cd} & \\mathrm{otherwise}\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7470,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Steel stress, elastic-plastic within ±fyd",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4s",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 7446,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\sigma_{s}\\left(\\varepsilon\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{|ll}\\displaystyle -f_{yd} & \\mathrm{if}\\ E_{s}\\varepsilon<-f_{yd}\\\\\\displaystyle f_{yd} & \\mathrm{if}\\ E_{s}\\varepsilon>f_{yd}\\\\\\displaystyle E_{s}\\varepsilon & \\mathrm{otherwise}\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7546,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "7. FLEXURAL CHECK",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7586,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "7.1 Biaxial resistance: P–Mθ at the moment direction θ",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7616,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "The neutral axis is turned (angle β of its normal) until the resisting moment points along θ;",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7646,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "this gives the P–Mθ curve at θ. No reduction to the principal axes.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7680,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Resultant design moment",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4y",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 7716,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "M_{Ed}\\coloneq\\sqrt{M_{Ed.x}^2+M_{Ed.y}^2}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "kN m",
        "precision": 1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_4z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7766,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Direction of the compression face (MEd,y → +x, MEd,x → +y)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_50",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 7766,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\theta_{M}\\coloneq\\mathrm{angle}\\left(M_{Ed.y},M_{Ed.x}\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "deg",
        "precision": 1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_51",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7816,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "For a neutral-axis direction β (normal of the axis, towards the compression face):",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_52",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7853,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Section depth along β",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_53",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 7846,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "H_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right)\\coloneq b\\left|\\cos\\left(\\beta\\right)\\right|+h\\left|\\sin\\left(\\beta\\right)\\right|",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_54",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7890,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Depth of the extreme bar",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_55",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 7916,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "d_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right)\\coloneq\\frac{H_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right)}{2}-\\min\\left(x_{s}\\cos\\left(\\beta\\right)+y_{s}\\sin\\left(\\beta\\right)\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_56",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 7980,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Stress in every concrete fibre at depth c",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_57",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 8006,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\sigma_{f}\\left(c,\\beta\\right)\\coloneq\\sigma_{c}\\left(\\varepsilon\\left(c,x_{f}\\cos\\left(\\beta\\right)+y_{f}\\sin\\left(\\beta\\right),H_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right),d_{\\beta}\\left(\\beta\\right)\\right)\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 18,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
